==Notes==
This spell only applies an effect to the caster, which module builders can test for using the [http://www.nwnlexicon.com/compiled/function.gethasspelleffect.html GetHasSpellEffect] function.  If the module builder has not put in instances where it will test for this spell, this spell is useless for players to take.
